{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Constitution 15 or higher\n\nYou are difficult to wear down and kill. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Constitution score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You have advantage on death saving throws.\n\n- Whenever you would get unconscious as a result of being reduced to 0 hit points, as a reaction, you can choose to avoid being downed. However, you are still subjected to making death saving throws while in this state and damage causes failed saves as normal. While in this state, you suffer one level of exhaustion at the end of your turn. You can choose to fall unconscious at any moment while in this state. You can only use this feature once per long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Custom9857822c-a2ad-4a5d-bc23-544d736dda40","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Diehard [TH] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}